{"4819620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Path Defenders: More Than Just Tower Defense", "steam_appid": 4819620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819620/extras/9b267a4c41a2b39b1b4863146f56b2f9.poster.avif?t=1787671103\" width=634 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819620/extras/9b267a4c41a2b39b1b4863146f56b2f9.webm?t=1787671103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819620/extras/9b267a4c41a2b39b1b4863146f56b2f9.mp4?t=1787671103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path Defenders is a 3D action tower defense RPG that puts you on the battlefield. Build a fantasy strategy party, summon units to hold the line, and jump in as a real-time hero to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ REAL-TIME HERO COMBAT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧙 BUILD A PARTY OF 25+ UNITS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐉 100+ ENEMY TYPES AND BOSS FIGHTS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⬆️ LEVEL UP AND PROGRESS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 STUNNING 3D FANTASY WORLD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proudly created and published by a solo indie developer.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819620/extras/9b267a4c41a2b39b1b4863146f56b2f9.poster.avif?t=1787671103\" width=634 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819620/extras/9b267a4c41a2b39b1b4863146f56b2f9.webm?t=1787671103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.aka